Subject: [PATCH] misc: mediatek: update shared CCCI declarations
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Expose the shared modem metadata and vendor API declarations required
by the utility and transport adapters.

Original-Commit: local development history
Original-Author: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Original-Date: 2026-10-20T07:19:48+08:00
Original-Commit: local development history
